id: JUDGE4-4
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: reject_four_scenes
target: crates/core/src/command_judge.rs
find: return CommandVerdict::MissingArg;
replace: return CommandVerdict::BadArgShape;
expect-fail: four_scenes_are_classified_100_percent
expect-fail: missing_and_shape_go_through_judge_input
note: 必須引数の不足を引数の形の違いに化けさせる（missing_arg が bad_arg_shape で返る）
